---
description: York / New Form visual system for all Resonant UI
globs: src/**/*.{tsx,css}
---

When building UI for this project, first run:
  designmdme --website <domain>

Then reference src/app/theme.css, src/app/variables.css, and src/app/tokens.json.

Hard rules from the York spec:
- Canvas is Bone White `#fafffa`. Headlines are Press Black `#121613`.
- Highlighter Green `#2bee4b` is the only saturated accent and the only filled CTA.
- Primary button: 5px radius, green fill, black 11px uppercase label, green-tinted shadow.
- Ghost buttons on dark: 10px radius, 1px bone border. Do not use 9999px on the primary action.
- Images: 14px radius and the green duotone filter. No full-color photography.
- UI type is Inter (TWK Lausanne substitute), 11px small-caps for nav/labels. Display is Instrument Serif (Mondwest substitute).
- Display sizes are huge (96–155px). Body stays at 18px.
- No second accent color. Elevation only on the green button.
- Brand stays Resonant. No skip / next control.
- Homepage still names Listen Now, Favorite Songs, Connect Apple Music.
- Every Noise atlas is navigation only — never write a genre field onto stored catalog records.
